cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and name the dataset version
  you used. Every version has pinned, unchanging downloads at
  https://kiankyars.github.io/datacenter-atlas/downloads/<version>/.
type: dataset
title: "Data Center Atlas: Verified Construction Core"
abstract: >-
  An open, evidence-backed dataset of data-centre construction worldwide. Each
  project has a dated, authoritative observation of physical construction work
  from the 90 days before a fixed lifecycle reference date (2026-08-20), a
  reviewed locator with explicit precision semantics, and closed-set evidence
  rows with source URLs, licences, retrieval times and content hashes. Version
  2026-08-20-v0.18-draft-thirty-fifth-reviewed (checkpoint 2026-09-25) contains
  197 physical sites with 200 projects in 46 countries, backed by 897 evidence
  rows. It is a reviewed draft, not a final release: imagery review and a blind
  re-review are incomplete. Statuses are the last observed physical status, not
  the current status; locators are not building footprints; capacity is unknown
  unless a typed observation exists; and the dataset is not a census.
authors:
